# FORGE CODEOWNERS
#
# M-D1: default reviewer required on every PR. Only current maintainer
# (rahulbhanushali) is listed; add team handles here once GitHub teams exist
# on the Forge-Studios-dev org so path-scoped ownership can grow without
# blocking every PR on a single reviewer.
#
# Syntax: last matching rule wins. Path patterns are relative to repo root.
# See https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositories-settings-and-security/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners

# ---- Default owner (catch-all) --------------------------------------------
*                                       @rahulbhanushali

# ---- Deploy / infra / CI (high-blast-radius) ------------------------------
# Force review of anything that can touch production deploy or secrets.
/.github/                               @rahulbhanushali
/.github/workflows/                     @rahulbhanushali
/.github/CODEOWNERS                     @rahulbhanushali
/fly.toml                               @rahulbhanushali
/fly.worker.toml                        @rahulbhanushali
/Dockerfile*                            @rahulbhanushali
/docker-compose*.yml                    @rahulbhanushali
/apps/api/Dockerfile*                   @rahulbhanushali
/apps/web/Dockerfile*                   @rahulbhanushali
/apps/admin/Dockerfile*                 @rahulbhanushali
/scripts/                               @rahulbhanushali
/infra/                                 @rahulbhanushali

# ---- Auth / security-sensitive backend ------------------------------------
/apps/api/src/modules/auth/             @rahulbhanushali
/apps/api/src/modules/entitlements/     @rahulbhanushali
/apps/api/src/config/                   @rahulbhanushali
/apps/api/src/database/                 @rahulbhanushali

# ---- Docs / audits --------------------------------------------------------
/docs/                                  @rahulbhanushali
/CLAUDE.md                              @rahulbhanushali
/README.md                              @rahulbhanushali
